<title>JAPAN: Japan Dec dept store sales fall 1.0 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Dec dept store sales fall 1.0 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sales at department stores in Japan in December fell 1.0 percent from a year earlier to 1.13 trillion yen, marking the first year-on-year drop in five months, the Japan Department Stores' Association said on Friday.</p>
<p>Sales at department stores in the whole of 1996 rose 1.8 percent from the previous year to 8.84 trillion yen, the association said in a statement.</p>
</text>
